<div class="file-content js-markup-content md">
<h1 id="user-content-sf-endorsements-and-other-endorsementsbuilder-guide-sites" data-sourcepos="1:1-1:60" dir="auto">SF endorsements and other endorsements/builder guide sites<a href="#sf-endorsements-and-other-endorsementsbuilder-guide-sites" aria-label="Link to heading 'SF endorsements and other endorsements/builder guide sites'" data-heading-content="SF endorsements and other endorsements/builder guide sites" class="anchor"></a></h1>
<p data-sourcepos="3:1-5:47" dir="auto">One Node app serves every city domain. San Francisco is
<a data-sourcepos="4:1-4:48" href="https://sfendorsements.com" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" target="_blank">sfendorsements.com</a>. Los Angeles is
<a data-sourcepos="5:1-5:46" href="https://lavoterguides.com" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" target="_blank">lavoterguides.com</a>.</p>
<p data-sourcepos="7:1-10:63" dir="auto">Each city lives in <code data-sourcepos="7:20-7:44">common/cities/&lt;cityId&gt;/</code> (config, organizations,
election files, sources). Heroes and icons live in
<code data-sourcepos="9:1-9:32">client/assets/cities/&lt;cityId&gt;/</code>. Preview another city on localhost
with <code data-sourcepos="10:6-10:23">?city=losAngeles</code> or <code data-sourcepos="10:28-10:62">http://losAngeles.localhost:61987</code>.</p>
<p data-sourcepos="12:1-13:37" dir="auto">To add the next city, run the <code data-sourcepos="12:31-12:40">add-city</code> skill
(<code data-sourcepos="13:2-13:35">.agents/skills/add-city/SKILL.md</code>).</p>

<h2 id="user-content-how-to-update" data-sourcepos="17:1-17:16" dir="auto">How to update<a href="#how-to-update" aria-label="Link to heading 'How to update'" data-heading-content="How to update" class="anchor"></a></h2>
<p data-sourcepos="19:1-20:59" dir="auto">To update a city for a new election, run these skills in order. Each one
is an agent skill in <code data-sourcepos="20:22-20:38">.agents/skills/</code> (same as a command).</p>

<ol data-sourcepos="24:1-36:59" dir="auto">
<li data-sourcepos="24:1-29:23">Add <code data-sourcepos="24:8-24:45">common/cities/&lt;cityId&gt;/&lt;Election&gt;.ts</code> with <code data-sourcepos="24:52-24:65">sections: []</code> and
<code data-sourcepos="25:4-25:21">endorsements: {}</code>. Add the election on that city's <code data-sourcepos="25:56-25:66">elections</code> list
in <code data-sourcepos="26:7-26:39">common/cities/&lt;cityId&gt;/index.ts</code> as the first entry. The first
entry is the home page; the previous one moves down and becomes a
past election. <code data-sourcepos="28:19-28:31">/past/:slug</code> serves archives — you do not add a Past
page or edit routes.</li>
<li data-sourcepos="30:1-31:34"><code data-sourcepos="30:4-30:27">1-fill-ballot-sections</code> — write the <code data-sourcepos="30:43-30:52">sections</code> array from the local
pamphlet and state voter guide.</li>
<li data-sourcepos="32:1-32:70"><code data-sourcepos="32:4-32:29">2a-check-ballot-sections</code> — compare the file to those pamphlets.</li>
<li data-sourcepos="33:1-33:71"><code data-sourcepos="33:4-33:34">2b-check-ballot-section-links</code> — check official proposition URLs.</li>
<li data-sourcepos="34:1-36:59"><code data-sourcepos="34:4-34:37">3a-get-endorsement-organizations</code> — seed org shells from the prior
election (new cities fill from <code data-sourcepos="35:35-35:52">organizations.ts</code>), then fill and
verify endorsements (<code data-sourcepos="36:25-36:28">3b</code> / <code data-sourcepos="36:32-36:35">3c</code> run as its sub-agents).</li>
</ol>
<p data-sourcepos="38:1-39:25" dir="auto">To build or reorder a city's organizations list, run
<code data-sourcepos="39:1-39:24">organize-organizations</code>.</p>
<p data-sourcepos="41:1-42:64" dir="auto">The old spreadsheet import (<code data-sourcepos="41:29-41:48">importTemplates.ts</code>) still exists if you
have a filled sheet. The skill pipeline above is the usual path.</p>
<p data-sourcepos="44:1-44:38" dir="auto">To update the server, SSH in, and run:</p>
<div class="gl-relative markdown-code-block js-markdown-code"><pre data-sourcepos="46:1-53:3" data-canonical-lang="sh" class="code highlight js-syntax-highlight language-shell code-syntax-highlight-theme" id="code-58"><code><span id="LC1" class="line" data-lang="shell"><span class="nb">cd</span> /home/web/app</span>
<span id="LC2" class="line" data-lang="shell">git pull</span>
<span id="LC3" class="line" data-lang="shell">yarn <span class="nb">install</span></span>
<span id="LC4" class="line" data-lang="shell">yarn build</span>
<span id="LC5" class="line" data-lang="shell">bash sysadmin/update-nginx.sh</span>
<span id="LC6" class="line" data-lang="shell">su <span class="nt">-c</span> <span class="s1">'pm2 restart all'</span> web</span></code></pre><copy-code><button type="button" class="btn btn-default btn-md gl-button btn-icon has-tooltip" data-title="Copy to clipboard" aria-label="Copy to clipboard" data-clipboard-target="pre#code-58"><svg><use xlink:href="/assets/icons-c33971e20f30a791de3ca935bad7098d65eac64b537ff98fed28c2589f917fd9.svg#copy-to-clipboard"></use></svg></button></copy-code></div>
